#ifndef LTC_SLANGH
#define LTC_SLANGH

// Linearly Transformed Cosines area-light evaluation, adapted to Slang from the GLSL
// reference implementation at https://github.com/selfshadow/ltc_code.
// Reference: Heitz, Dupuy, Hill, Neubelt, "Real-Time Polygonal-Light Shading with
// Linearly Transformed Cosines", ACM TOG (Proc. SIGGRAPH 2016) 35(4), 2016.
// Rectangular lights only. The two lookup tables (ltc_mat, ltc_mag) are declared
// in ve_common.slangh at set 6, bindings 2 and 3.
//
//
// License (https://github.com/selfshadow/ltc_code/blob/master/LICENSE):
// Copyright (c) 2017, Eric Heitz, Jonathan Dupuy, Stephen Hill and David Neubelt.
// All rights reserved.
// Redistribution and use in source and binary forms, with or without modification,
// are permitted provided that the following conditions are met:
